The background wrapper exited because nohup background inside; actual make continues detached. Check log periodically. Now write nginx config.

Nginx config:

server {
    listen 80 default_server;
    listen [::]:80 default_server;
    server_name _;
    root /usr/share/novnc;
    index vnc.html;
    location / {
        try_files $uri $uri/ /vnc.html;
    }
    location /websockify {
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;
        proxy_set_header Connection "upgrade";
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_read_timeout 3600s;
        proxy_send_timeout 3600s;
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:6080;
    }
}

Need websockify running: `websockify --web /usr/share/novnc 127.0.0.1:6080 127.0.0.1:5901`. But if nginx serves static, websockify can skip web; still `--web` okay. Actually noVNC static root served by nginx. For websocket path /websockify, proxy_pass strips? proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:6080; preserves URI /websockify. websockify expects any path? It accepts. Fine.

Could avoid second process by nginx serving noVNC and using noVNC's `?path=...` and websockify. Still need websockify because nginx cannot proxy raw VNC. Could use nginx stream module, but no.

Start websockify detached. Let's write config and test.

